# Commit messages

Write commit messages as plain descriptions of the change. Do not sign them.

- Do not add an assistant, model, or tool signature.
- Do not add "Generated with", "Co-Authored-By", or similar trailers for an AI assistant.
- One short subject line. A second sentence is optional when the reason is not obvious.

```
Add organization verification review

```

```
Add organization verification review

Generated with Cursor
Co-Authored-By: Grok
```
